"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":0},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":1},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":2},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":3},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":4},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":5},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":6}],"implementation_sha256":"131f4f7f23b2e42d328524b5bb9fc244b2bc41b48c789b30a4d4058a67459a48","source_authority_verified":false,"semantic_entailment_verified":false,"subject_predicate_binding_verified":false},"withheld_originals":[],"checked_assessments":7,"implementation_sha256":"9f54ec23b995b22da0fe3016f42aa74159963c9bf25add83232b55995d7f04b5","semantic_entailment_verified":false}},{"name":"verify_and_submit_report","step":2,"event":"tool","output":{"status":"answered","accepted":true},"arguments":{"assessments":[{"basis":"documented_fact","verdict":"supported","statement":"Juniper 生产集群上 Alder Relay 1.8 遇到传输超时最多能尝试 3 次","explanation":"根据签名的集群配置注册表，Juniper 生产集群运行 Alder Relay 1.8，其 effective total_attempts=3。","evidence_ids":["pe2a396f909e83167"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","verdict":"supported","statement":"Juniper 生产集群上 Alder Relay 1.8 的重试次数为 2 次","explanation":"总尝试次数为 3 次，包含初始尝试，因此重试次数为 3 - 1 = 2 次。","evidence_ids":["pe2a396f909e83167"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","verdict":"supported","statement":"Alder Relay 1.8 不会重试 HTTP 4xx 响应","explanation":"1.8 版本快速入门明确指出，HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试。","evidence_ids":["p0a6da40a7e230b09"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","verdict":"supported","statement":"培训材料称‘2.4 一律三次’与正式资料冲突","explanation":"更正说明指出该幻灯片复制了旧的 1.8 版本快速入门，从未被批准为 2.4 版本策略，因此与正式资料冲突。","evidence_ids":["p4fd32c80240892ee"]}]}},{"name":"verify_and_submit_report","step":2,"event":"stage_finished","phase":"tool","outcome":"returned","stage_id":"s4","elapsed_ms":48925.651,"duration_ms":24635.78,"remaining_ms":26074.349,"parent_stage_id":null}],"version":"workspace-agent-v9","max_steps":6,"tool_calls":2,"snapshot_id":"edb83909-9509-4d9a-84ad-a3ecde6d1f17:4","budget_seconds":75.0,"max_tool_calls":8,"max_model_calls":7,"documents_sha256":"5b374c905dfd375db41b1df406efa5ce26e76c1ad2d1f524d7d5fe06b719b67c","decision_protocol":"json_schema_action_v1","telemetry_version":"runtime-stages-v1","verified_chunk_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8","chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"],"implementation_sha256":"6dcb6c0628a6b745e69659d6e5dba140447544b9028542e522c4ff1b0b137377","review_reserve_seconds":20.0},"usage":{"model_calls":3,"embedded_inputs":0,"budget_exhausted":false,"embedding_tokens":0,"generation_tokens":{"total_tokens":15586,"prompt_tokens":14396,"completion_tokens":1190},"embedding_requests":0,"embedding_cache_hits":0,"provider_usage_unknown":false},"answer":"【证据支持】Juniper 生产集群上 Alder Relay 1.8 遇到传输超时最多能尝试 3 次\nJuniper 生产集群上 Alder Relay 1.8 遇到传输超时最多能尝试 3 次，依据为签名的集群配置注册表中 effective total_attempts=3。 [chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe]\n\n【证据支持】Juniper 生产集群上 Alder Relay 1.8 的重试次数为 2 次\n总尝试次数为 3 次，包含初始尝试，因此重试次数为 3 - 1 = 2 次。 [chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe]\n\n【证据支持】Alder Relay 1.8 不会重试 HTTP 4xx 响应\nAlder Relay 1.8 快速入门明确指出，HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试。 [chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5]\n\n【证据支持】培训材料称‘2.4 一律三次’与正式资料冲突\n培训材料称‘2.4 一律三次’，但更正说明指出该幻灯片复制了旧的 1.8 版本快速入门，从未被批准为 2.4 版本策略，因此与正式资料冲突。 [chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8]\n\n【证据支持】总尝试次数：与上一轮相比的变更或保留结论及依据。\n根据签名的集群配置注册表，Juniper 生产集群运行 Alder Relay 1.8，其 effective total_attempts=3，与上一轮针对 Cedar 2.4 的 total_attempts=2 不同，因此总尝试次数需变更。 [chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe]\n\n【证据支持】重试次数：与上一轮相比的变更或保留结论及依据。\nJuniper 1.8 的重试次数为 3 - 1 = 2 次，而上一轮 Cedar 2.4 为 2 - 1 = 1 次，数值不同，因此重试次数需变更。 [chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe]\n\n【证据支持】4xx 处理：与上一轮相比的变更或保留结论及依据。\nAlder Relay 1.8 与 2.4 均规定 HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试，策略一致，因此 4xx 处理保留不变。 [chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5] [chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd]\n\n用户提供的范围（非证据结论；本轮明确更正优先于已保存内容）：\n当前提问：\"更正一下，目标其实是 Juniper 生产集群，它还在用 1.8。请据此修正上一轮的结论，明确指出总尝试次数、重试次数和 4xx 处理这三项中哪些需要变更、哪些保留，并说明依据。\"\n保存的目标：\"依据工作区资料判断指定版本和集群的重试规则，并保留版本适用范围。\"\n保存的限制：[\"用中文回答。\", \"总尝试次数与重试次数分开表述。\", \"不把用户提供的线索自动当作已核实的资料事实。\"]\n保存的对象（可能已被本轮更正覆盖）：\"版本与部署适用范围\"","claims":[{"text":"Juniper 生产集群上 Alder Relay 1.8 遇到传输超时最多能尝试 3 次，依据为签名的集群配置注册表中 effective total_attempts=3。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"text":"总尝试次数为 3 次，包含初始尝试，因此重试次数为 3 - 1 = 2 次。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"text":"Alder Relay 1.8 快速入门明确指出，HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5"]},{"text":"培训材料称‘2.4 一律三次’，但更正说明指出该幻灯片复制了旧的 1.8 版本快速入门，从未被批准为 2.4 版本策略，因此与正式资料冲突。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8"]},{"text":"根据签名的集群配置注册表，Juniper 生产集群运行 Alder Relay 1.8，其 effective total_attempts=3，与上一轮针对 Cedar 2.4 的 total_attempts=2 不同，因此总尝试次数需变更。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"text":"Juniper 1.8 的重试次数为 3 - 1 = 2 次，而上一轮 Cedar 2.4 为 2 - 1 = 1 次，数值不同，因此重试次数需变更。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"text":"Alder Relay 1.8 与 2.4 均规定 HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试，策略一致，因此 4xx 处理保留不变。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"]}],"status":"answered","context":{"version":"conversation-context-v1","input_turns":1,"persistence":"owned_by_workspace_service","pinned_state":{"goal":"依据工作区资料判断指定版本和集群的重试规则，并保留版本适用范围。","focus":"版本与部署适用范围","constraints":["用中文回答。","总尝试次数与重试次数分开表述。","不把用户提供的线索自动当作已核实的资料事实。"]},"omitted_turns":0,"context_budget":{"calls":[{"fits":true,"phase":"decision_1","input_units":15998,"window_units":65536,"dropped_turns":0,"retained_turns":1,"tool_pairs_valid":true,"visible_chunk_ids":[],"readable_chunk_ids":[],"decision_tool_names":["search_workspace","request_clarification"],"evidence_projection":"visible-exact-passages-v1","total_reserved_units":19622,"read_action_available":false,"visible_passage_count":0,"dropped_tool_exchanges":0,"dropped_turn_sequences":[],"pinned_state_preserved":true,"retained_tool_exchanges":0,"retained_turn_sequences":[1],"current_question_preserved":true,"deduplicated_passage_count":0,"observed_source_ids_preserved":[],"repeated_quote_utf8_bytes_removed":0},{"fits":true,"phase":"decision_2","input_units":22321,"window_units":65536,"dropped_turns":0,"retained_turns":1,"tool_pairs_valid":true,"visible_chunk_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8","chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"],"readable_chunk_ids":[],"decision_tool_names":["search_workspace","request_clarification","verify_and_submit_report"],"evidence_projection":"visible-exact-passages-v1","total_reserved_units":25945,"read_action_available":false,"visible_passage_count":4,"dropped_tool_exchanges":0,"dropped_turn_sequences":[],"pinned_state_preserved":true,"retained_tool_exchanges":1,"retained_turn_sequences":[1],"current_question_preserved":true,"deduplicated_passage_count":0,"observed_source_ids_preserved":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8","chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"],"repeated_quote_utf8_bytes_removed":0},{"fits":true,"phase":"final_evidence_review","input_units":26998,"window_units":65536,"evidence_pruned":false,"total_reserved_units":30622}],"estimator":"serialized_utf8_bytes_plus_framing_v1","limitation":"Conservative byte estimate, not a model-specific tokenizer or exact provider limit guarantee.","window_units":65536,"safety_margin":1024,"output_reserve":2600,"exact_tokenizer":false},"conversation_id":"a806e7ce-d6bc-4739-af3d-f94333277bca","state_authority":"user_pinned_scope_not_verified_facts","history_authority":"untrusted_context_requiring_source_retrieval","automatic_fact_memory":false,"conversation_revision":2,"implementation_sha256":"91536a11f0c882313f658115e5f862ec0089d07ff92e2edd3eb6d4aa3df24bf6"},"question":"更正一下，目标其实是 Juniper 生产集群，它还在用 1.8。请据此修正上一轮的结论，明确指出总尝试次数、重试次数和 4xx 处理这三项中哪些需要变更、哪些保留，并说明依据。","citations":[{"end":349,"text":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","start":0,"title":"Alder Relay signed fleet configuration register","source":"synthetic:alder/fleet-register","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","document_id":"ar-deployments","content_sha256":"b2fdfed57f5adbc64b3b24e01027ba2d3d401cd6f35bfcc381b96b9b54998af5"},{"end":320,"text":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart. Scope: release 1.8 only. A request may be attempted at most three times in total: the initial attempt and at most two retries. Only a transport timeout is retryable. HTTP 4xx responses are final and must not be retried. This document is not a policy for later major policy revisions.","start":0,"title":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart","source":"synthetic:alder/quickstart-1.8","chunk_id":"chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","document_id":"ar-legacy","content_sha256":"b3b63803a30a935fe32b8ed1501bc3e862a11ea127a1c690e36d5b01c15ea4cb"},{"end":368,"text":"Training slide 17 was labelled 'Alder Relay 2.4: three attempts everywhere'. Editorial correction dated 2028-02-10: the slide copied the old 1.8 quickstart and was never approved as the 2.4 retry policy. Do not use it to determine 2.4 defaults or a cluster's effective value. Use the approved 2.4 normative policy together with the signed fleet configuration register.","start":0,"title":"Unapproved Alder Relay training slide correction","source":"synthetic:alder/training-erratum","chunk_id":"chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8","document_id":"ar-training","content_sha256":"d548c38d7d622c7dfb6623c8f5fd4452bb36a6dc1e9e8137521c6507bb78c186"},{"end":452,"text":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy, approved 2028-02-04. The default total_attempts value is 1, including the initial attempt. A signed deployment configuration may override total_attempts to an integer from 1 to 4. Only a transport timeout is retryable; HTTP 4xx responses remain final and must not be retried. The deployment value takes precedence over this default. A retry allowance is a ceiling, not evidence that any request actually retried.","start":0,"title":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy","source":"synthetic:alder/policy-2.4","chunk_id":"chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd","document_id":"ar-current","content_sha256":"f684ffaac1cc7427811b7c0fb3de64991c323b32fe879e6f636cb75eb84c0283"}],"retrieval":{"hits":[{"end":349,"rank":1,"text":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","score":2.0838336391,"start":0,"title":"Alder Relay signed fleet configuration register","source":"synthetic:alder/fleet-register","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","bm25_score":2.0838336391,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"ar-deployments","content_sha256":"b2fdfed57f5adbc64b3b24e01027ba2d3d401cd6f35bfcc381b96b9b54998af5"},{"end":320,"rank":2,"text":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart. Scope: release 1.8 only. A request may be attempted at most three times in total: the initial attempt and at most two retries. Only a transport timeout is retryable. HTTP 4xx responses are final and must not be retried. This document is not a policy for later major policy revisions.","score":1.0990050231,"start":0,"title":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart","source":"synthetic:alder/quickstart-1.8","chunk_id":"chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","bm25_score":1.0990050231,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"ar-legacy","content_sha256":"b3b63803a30a935fe32b8ed1501bc3e862a11ea127a1c690e36d5b01c15ea4cb"},{"end":368,"rank":3,"text":"Training slide 17 was labelled 'Alder Relay 2.4: three attempts everywhere'. Editorial correction dated 2028-02-10: the slide copied the old 1.8 quickstart and was never approved as the 2.4 retry policy. Do not use it to determine 2.4 defaults or a cluster's effective value. Use the approved 2.4 normative policy together with the signed fleet configuration register.","score":0.745272403,"start":0,"title":"Unapproved Alder Relay training slide correction","source":"synthetic:alder/training-erratum","chunk_id":"chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8","bm25_score":0.745272403,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"ar-training","content_sha256":"d548c38d7d622c7dfb6623c8f5fd4452bb36a6dc1e9e8137521c6507bb78c186"},{"end":452,"rank":4,"text":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy, approved 2028-02-04. The default total_attempts value is 1, including the initial attempt. A signed deployment configuration may override total_attempts to an integer from 1 to 4. Only a transport timeout is retryable; HTTP 4xx responses remain final and must not be retried. The deployment value takes precedence over this default. A retry allowance is a ceiling, not evidence that any request actually retried.","score":0.4359745475,"start":0,"title":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy","source":"synthetic:alder/policy-2.4","chunk_id":"chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd","bm25_score":0.4359745475,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"ar-current","content_sha256":"f684ffaac1cc7427811b7c0fb3de64991c323b32fe879e6f636cb75eb84c0283"}],"searches":[{"query":"Juniper 生产集群 Alder Relay 1.8 配置 重试 次数","top_k":5,"strategy":"bm25","chunk_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8","chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"],"transport":"loopback_http","snapshot_id":"edb83909-9509-4d9a-84ad-a3ecde6d1f17:4","documents_sha256":"5b374c905dfd375db41b1df406efa5ce26e76c1ad2d1f524d7d5fe06b719b67c"}],"strategy":"bm25","chunk_count":4,"snapshot_id":"edb83909-9509-4d9a-84ad-a3ecde6d1f17:4","document_count":4,"strategy_scope":"approved strategy; searches records actual model choices","documents_sha256":"5b374c905dfd375db41b1df406efa5ce26e76c1ad2d1f524d7d5fe06b719b67c"},"latency_ms":48925.659,"user_scope":{"authority":"user_provided_context_not_verified_evidence","precedence":"Current explicit corrections override saved focus and older messages. Saved fields are recorded inputs, not an assertion that they still apply.","saved_goal":"依据工作区资料判断指定版本和集群的重试规则，并保留版本适用范围。","saved_focus":"版本与部署适用范围","current_question":"更正一下，目标其实是 Juniper 生产集群，它还在用 1.8。请据此修正上一轮的结论，明确指出总尝试次数、重试次数和 4xx 处理这三项中哪些需要变更、哪些保留，并说明依据。","saved_constraints":["用中文回答。","总尝试次数与重试次数分开表述。","不把用户提供的线索自动当作已核实的资料事实。"]},"assessments":[{"basis":"documented_fact","quotes":[{"quote":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"}],"verdict":"supported","statement":"Juniper 生产集群上 Alder Relay 1.8 遇到传输超时最多能尝试 3 次","explanation":"Juniper 生产集群上 Alder Relay 1.8 遇到传输超时最多能尝试 3 次，依据为签名的集群配置注册表中 effective total_attempts=3。","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","quotes":[{"quote":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"}],"verdict":"supported","statement":"Juniper 生产集群上 Alder Relay 1.8 的重试次数为 2 次","explanation":"总尝试次数为 3 次，包含初始尝试，因此重试次数为 3 - 1 = 2 次。","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","quotes":[{"quote":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart. Scope: release 1.8 only. A request may be attempted at most three times in total: the initial attempt and at most two retries. Only a transport timeout is retryable. HTTP 4xx responses are final and must not be retried. This document is not a policy for later major policy revisions.","chunk_id":"chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5"}],"verdict":"supported","statement":"Alder Relay 1.8 不会重试 HTTP 4xx 响应","explanation":"Alder Relay 1.8 快速入门明确指出，HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试。","citation_ids":["chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","quotes":[{"quote":"Training slide 17 was labelled 'Alder Relay 2.4: three attempts everywhere'. Editorial correction dated 2028-02-10: the slide copied the old 1.8 quickstart and was never approved as the 2.4 retry policy. Do not use it to determine 2.4 defaults or a cluster's effective value. Use the approved 2.4 normative policy together with the signed fleet configuration register.","chunk_id":"chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8"}],"verdict":"supported","statement":"培训材料称‘2.4 一律三次’与正式资料冲突","explanation":"培训材料称‘2.4 一律三次’，但更正说明指出该幻灯片复制了旧的 1.8 版本快速入门，从未被批准为 2.4 版本策略，因此与正式资料冲突。","citation_ids":["chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","quotes":[{"quote":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"}],"verdict":"supported","statement":"总尝试次数：与上一轮相比的变更或保留结论及依据。","explanation":"根据签名的集群配置注册表，Juniper 生产集群运行 Alder Relay 1.8，其 effective total_attempts=3，与上一轮针对 Cedar 2.4 的 total_attempts=2 不同，因此总尝试次数需变更。","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","quotes":[{"quote":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"}],"verdict":"supported","statement":"重试次数：与上一轮相比的变更或保留结论及依据。","explanation":"Juniper 1.8 的重试次数为 3 - 1 = 2 次，而上一轮 Cedar 2.4 为 2 - 1 = 1 次，数值不同，因此重试次数需变更。","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","quotes":[{"quote":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart. Scope: release 1.8 only. A request may be attempted at most three times in total: the initial attempt and at most two retries. Only a transport timeout is retryable. HTTP 4xx responses are final and must not be retried. This document is not a policy for later major policy revisions.","chunk_id":"chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5"},{"quote":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy, approved 2028-02-04. The default total_attempts value is 1, including the initial attempt. A signed deployment configuration may override total_attempts to an integer from 1 to 4. Only a transport timeout is retryable; HTTP 4xx responses remain final and must not be retried. The deployment value takes precedence over this default. A retry allowance is a ceiling, not evidence that any request actually retried.","chunk_id":"chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"}],"verdict":"supported","statement":"4xx 处理：与上一轮相比的变更或保留结论及依据。","explanation":"Alder Relay 1.8 与 2.4 均规定 HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试，策略一致，因此 4xx 处理保留不变。","citation_ids":["chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"]}],"limitations":["The model chooses the tools and report assessments; semantic entailment is not independently verified.","Source labels are metadata; exact quote verification does not authenticate a source.","Time budgets stop further calls; in-flight provider requests cannot be forcibly cancelled."],"evidence_verdict":"supported","generation_review":{"calls":1,"model":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507","scope":"Same-provider model review followed by mechanical checks; not independent human review or proof of entailment","draft_sha256":"200172e9d5ff59a674b1ab5e489adbf100c20bcb2956f3682a2900a7d5161772","payload_format":"scoped-review-ids-v2","review_context":{"version":"source-scoped-review-context-v1","available_passage_ids":["pe2a396f909e83167","p0a6da40a7e230b09","p4fd32c80240892ee","p11e54de123e96be2"],"implementation_sha256":"68b670a3ddafa6ac69a0c8318c27641e9060424c00f8d07fd5f87f3b5ab063ee","previous_scope_status":"user_message_available_not_disambiguated","available_passage_count":4,"scope_resolution_verified":false,"evidence_coverage_verified":false,"minimum_evidence_requested":false,"requested_comparison_items":["总尝试次数","重试次数","4xx 处理"],"semantic_correctness_verified":false},"reviewed_sha256":"1b4db778e663a906e4e62d7c8b2947ec71392ab6bbd327f720b2a288daabe80e","request_body_bytes":26614},"assessment_validation":{"adjustments":[],"quote_scope":"All factual citations and every supplied quote; insufficient assessments may cite context without quotes","exact_quotes":true,"causal_certification":false,"selected_evidence_checks":{"version":"selected-evidence-checks-v3","findings":[],"evidence_binding":{"scope":"One current-user named pair and positive current-config snake_case scalar literals; selected quotes only","version":"row-local-literal-binding-v1","findings":[],"named_pair":[],"assessments":[{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":0},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":1},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":2},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":3},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":4},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"assessment_index":5},{"subject":{"state":"unverified","reason":"no_single_explicit_current_user_pair"},"configuration":{"state":"unverified","reason":"not_supported_current_configuration"},"a